* STM32 memory\nprotection
** RDP levels
*** L0 open, debug on
*** L1 debug blocks\nflash access
*** L2 permanent,\nno JTAG, no DFU
*** set at bagging time
** Write protection
*** WRP1AR covers\n14 pages
*** bootloader cannot\nbe erased
*** survives DFU
** The firewall
*** code segment\n+ non-volatile data
*** violation resets\nthe chip
*** single call gate
*** prearm discipline
** PCROP
*** exec-only
*** D-bus blocked even\nfrom inside
*** documented but\nnot used here
** OTP area
*** 128 write-once\n64-bit slots
*** version high-water
*** downgrade block
** Flash ECC
*** 8 bits per 64
*** corrects 1, detects 2
*** NMI on 2-bit error
*** UV-C attack becomes\na brick
** Residual
*** glitching still\npossible
*** rng_delay jitter
*** factory mode is\nthe weak window
@endmindmap
